<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 10.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 10.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines from Estonia's Kuku radio noon news report on Thursday.  Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- The first troops are arriving for the Baltic Challenge 97 exercise.</p>
<p>- A U.S. Coast Guard vessel is visiting Tallinn.</p>
<p>- The Moe distillery has restarted exports.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
